+From 5ad8cf24897ff903112967a9662cb13ed4cbbf57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Ziyang Huang <hzyitc@outlook.com>
+Date: Mon, 22 Apr 2024 21:47:58 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH] syn-gmac: use standard DMA api
